*** Table rate shipping for WooCommerce Changelog *** 

2025-01-28 - version 2.1.4
* Fixed - Conflict with another method data while editing the shipping method.  
* Fixed - Characters (@, <, #, %, etc.) were not allowed in the method title.  
* Fixed - "Per line item" option not working.  
* Fixed - Default selection in the table of rates not working.  
* Fixed - "Hide other option" not working in the table of rates.  
* Fixed - "Hide other shipping option when free shipping is available" not working.  
* Fixed - Weekend days exclusion condition not working.  
* Fixed - Product visibility includes/excludes not working correctly for shipping methods.  
* Fixed - Shipping charges calculated incorrectly for included and excluded product categories.  
* Fixed - Issue where the second shipping method was shown only when identical conditions were used in multiple shipping methods.  
* Fixed - Incorrect shipping costs when multiple conditions were applied to the same shipping method.  
* Added - Allowed numeric data in city settings.  
* Fixed - Table of rates not working as per conditions when more than one shipping method was added.  
* Fixed - Base table rules not working.  
* Fixed - "Set delivery date automatically" not working in the cart.

2025-01-15 - version 2.1.3

* Added - Compatibility with WooCommerce version 8.4
* Fixed - General bug fixes

2024-12-20 - version 2.1.2

* Fixed - WooCommerce settings save button issue

2024-11-30 - version 2.1.1

* Fixed - WPML dynamic title translation issue

2024-10-15 - version 2.1.0

* Fixed - ReferenceError on table rate shipping listing page
* Fixed - Conflict issue with incorrect data in the shipping editor
* 2024-08-25 - version 2.0.6
* Fixed - Delivery date error issue in the backend

2024-06-10 - version 2.0.5

* Fixed - Issue with adding shipping method to a specific role
* Fixed - Handling fee taxable/non-taxable issue
* Disabled - Non-supported file formats while importing from CSV
* Fixed - Clicking issue on the title in the method listing page
* Fixed - Combined description with multiple options in a method
* Added - Character limit for description and number fields
* Disabled - Negative values in the number fields
* Added - Subtitles and popup descriptions for each option
* Added - Proper placeholders in all fields
* Added - Delete button for empty options
* Disabled - Special characters in text fields like option titles and method titles
* Disabled - Saving shipping options without a valid name
* Fixed - Flat rate visibility when no conditions match or options are empty

2024-05-05 - version 2.0.4

* Fixed - PHP error on the cart page when adding products to the cart
* Fixed - Hide other methods issue for specific city settings
* Disabled - Negative numbers for weight, delivery day, flat rate, etc.
* Added - Option to hide/show delivery dates

2024-03-20 - version 2.0.3

* Fixed - Tax calculation error
* Fixed - Admin page conflict when trying to edit
* Fixed - Update issue with specific shipping method IDs
* Fixed - Shipping zone error in the general tab
* Fixed - Empty value issues

2024-01-15 - version 2.0.2

* Fixed - Bank data issue while editing existing methods

2023-11-30 - version 2.0.1

* Updated - ReactJS dependency to Node version 7.19.1
* Updated - React Router DOM to version 6.0.2
* Fixed - Tax error on shipping

2023-10-05 - version 2.0.0

* Upgraded - Design improvements
* Disabled - Access from WooCommerce > Settings
* Added - Settings page under WooCommerce > New Custom Page
* Added - List of all table rate shipping methods as the landing page
* Updated - UI changes in the table rates tab
* Added - Enable/Disable toggle button on the list page
* Added - Number of options for each method on the list page
* Added - Delete option from the list page
* Updated - Shipping zone settings in the general tab
* Improved - User-friendliness and more

2020-08-15 - version 1.0.3

* Fixed - Issues caused by WPML class

2020-05-30 - version 1.0.2

* Fixed - Error when creating multiple methods in the "Table of Rate" tab

2020-03-10 - version 1.0.1

* Added - Compatibility with WooCommerce version 5.1.0

2020-01-05 - version 1.0.0

* Initial release

